/Title (Audio is diegetic only and the perspective changes with the camera: outside the car, flat-six engine echoing hard off the buildings on both sides, sharp upshifts, exhaust crackle, tyre roar on tarmac, prop whine and wind buffeting on the drone's own microphone. Inside the cabin the wind roar dominates and the engine goes boomy and enclosed for those beats, then opens back out as the drone exits. No music of any kind. No voice, no dialogue.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 675 0 R
>>
