926 0 obj
<<
/Title (One continuous 10-second FPV drone shot, no cuts, real time. A red sports coupe runs flat-out down an empty city street with its windows down; the drone chases from behind, flies in through the driver's window for a close look at his face, pulls back out and rolls a full barrel roll around the car, grazing beneath it before unwinding level ahead of it. Diegetic sound only, no music.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 913 0 R
>>
endobj
